00:33:15,549 --> 00:33:18,599
Wow, well, my grandparents used to go to church, but they got hurt,

772
00:33:18,616 --> 00:33:20,116
and so they didn't bring my parents.

773
00:33:20,166 --> 00:33:20,883
Now I don't go.

774
00:33:21,016 --> 00:33:21,966
Do you see where it could go?

775
00:33:22,033 --> 00:33:24,549
You know how to combat that?

776
00:33:24,616 --> 00:33:26,283
Serve.

777
00:33:26,416 --> 00:33:28,266
Love each other.

778
00:33:28,333 --> 00:33:30,299
Show mercy on each other.

779
00:33:30,366 --> 00:33:32,933
I'm gonna tell you right now, I'm gonna mess up.

780
00:33:33,016 --> 00:33:35,833
I'm gonna probably hurt your feelings, and I don't mean to.

781
00:33:35,900 --> 00:33:38,349
Sometimes I didn't mean to, and I need to confess that.

782
00:33:38,416 --> 00:33:41,533
But listen, hey, I can't we can't stay there.

783
00:33:41,599 --> 00:33:44,900
Just like I want to show mercy to you.

784
00:33:45,016 --> 00:33:46,816
I need you to show mercy to me.

785
00:33:46,866 --> 00:33:49,983
Because God's shown mercy to all this.

786
00:33:50,049 --> 00:33:51,183
It has bound eyes closed over this place.

787
00:33:51,250 --> 00:33:52,750
I just wonder what the Holy Spirit's doing right now.
